# All production-model weight files must be LFS-tracked. Without this,
# huggingface_hub.upload_folder auto-LFSes them on the HF Space (its
# default behavior for *.bin ML weights), but our repo treats them as
# raw blobs -- the mismatch causes HF's Docker build to COPY the LFS
# pointer text files instead of resolved content, and torch.load fails
# with "invalid load key, 'v'" (the 'v' of "version https://git-lfs/...").
# Forcing LFS here keeps the representation consistent end-to-end.
models/openhands-modernized/production-models/**/*.bin filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
